/-! ### Images of the seven generators -/

/- Each image is an involution given by the table of its images, packed as in the model file: 60
hexadecimal rows of 30 entries of three digits (the last row holds the remaining 12), the entry of
the point `30 * r + j` being the group of three digits of row `r` in position `j` counted from the
right, read as field `30 * r + j` of width `12` of the natural number having the rows as its
digits in base `2 ^ 360`. The bodies are exposed so that importing modules can compute with the
seven permutations. -/

